WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.442 --> 00:00:06.546
Tap a coin in the palette to put it on the board.

2
00:00:06.546 --> 00:00:11.021
Today’s task: make 67¢ in two different ways.

3
00:00:11.021 --> 00:00:13.377
The total at the top counts it for you.

4
00:00:13.377 --> 00:00:18.177
Drag across empty board to select many pieces at once.

5
00:00:18.177 --> 00:00:20.709
Drag one of them and they all move together.

6
00:00:20.709 --> 00:00:24.983
Way two: hold a quarter and pick Delete.

7
00:00:24.983 --> 00:00:29.981
Trade it for two dimes and a nickel. Still 67¢.

8
00:00:29.981 --> 00:00:33.992
Turn Totals off so the class counts it themselves.

9
00:00:33.992 --> 00:00:41.528
Every task has its prompt and a teacher note, below the board.
